# Swipe File

Strong examples worth imitating. Emails that landed, posts that worked, decks that closed, openings that hooked.

The habit: before drafting anything, show the AI a strong example from here, have it extract the patterns (structure, tone, length, moves), then apply those patterns to the new piece. Imitate structure, not words.

Drop examples in named by what they're good at, e.g. `cold-outreach-that-got-a-reply.md`, `tight-status-update.md`.
